# Hotel Rudrajya — Environment Variables Example
# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values.

# ─── Backend / Booking API ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# If you integrate a real booking backend (e.g. Supabase), add keys here.
# NEVER commit your real .env file to version control.

# Example — Supabase (optional, only if you add a real backend):
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# ─── Hotel Contact (override data/hotelData.ts values here if preferred) ──────
# VITE_HOTEL_PHONE=+91 00000 00000
# VITE_HOTEL_EMAIL=info@hotelrudrajya.com
# VITE_HOTEL_WHATSAPP=910000000000
# VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_URL=https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=...
